---
version: 2.0.0
title: compiler__return_multiple_values_ending_with_call
---
return 0, true, fun()

------------------------------

function main(...) --from line 1 to line 1
    LOADCONSTANT in: 1, constant: 0
    LOADCONSTANT in: 2, constant: true
    GETGLOBAL to: 3, name: fun
    CALL function: 3, arg_count: 0, result_count: -1
    RETURN starting: 1, count: 1
end
